5. Working moves
----------------
1. Do not quotient marked observer data until it is split into start+end and start-end analogues.
2. For LRC14, tag every clock as invariant scalar, anti/owner channel, or transporter between perspectives.
3. Use even scalar gates to shrink search; use odd derivative/owner channels to prove pressure or descent.
4. Treat HYP-2458 odd atoms as incomplete until an OCF-style compatibility packet ledger is attached.
5. When a scalar gate passes in code72/unit-distance/polynomials, immediately ask which support lift was forgotten.
